{"id":"H8555","lemma":"תִּמְנָע","transliteration":"timna","sayIt":"tim-NA","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Timna","meaning":"A woman living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Gen.36.12; married to Eliphaz (H0464);\nmother of: Amalek (H6002H)\n§ Timna or Timnah = \"restrained\"\n1) a chief or duke of Esau and of Edom\n2) the concubine of Eliphaz, the son of Esau\n3) daughter of Seir the Horite and sister of Lotan","glosses":["timna","additionally"],"count":6,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-36","v":12,"renderings":{"bsb":"Additionally","kjv":"And Timna"}},{"chapterId":"gen-36","v":22,"renderings":{"bsb":"Timna"}},{"chapterId":"gen-36","v":40,"renderings":{"bsb":"Timna","kjv":"Timnah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-1","v":36,"renderings":{"bsb":"and by Timna","kjv":"and Timna"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-1","v":39,"renderings":{"bsb":"Timna","kjv":"and Timna"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-1","v":51,"renderings":{"bsb":"Timna","kjv":"Timnah"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Genesis 36:12","note":"Timna was concubine to Eliphaz, Esau’s son; and she bore to Eliphaz Amalek. These are the descendants of Adah, Esau’s wife.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 1:36","note":"The sons of Eliphaz: Teman, Omar, Zephi, Gatam, Kenaz, Timna, and Amalek.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H1787","lemma":"דִּישֹׁן","transliteration":"dishon","gloss":"Dishon"},{"id":"H1789","lemma":"דִּישָׁן","transliteration":"dishan","gloss":"Dishan"},{"id":"H0464","lemma":"אֱלִיפַז","transliteration":"eliphaz","gloss":"Eliphaz"},{"id":"H0687","lemma":"אֵ֫צֶר","transliteration":"etser","gloss":"Ezer"},{"id":"H3877","lemma":"לוֹטָן","transliteration":"lotan","gloss":"Lotan"},{"id":"H6002","lemma":"עֲמָלֵק","transliteration":"amaleq","gloss":"Amalek"},{"id":"H6034","lemma":"עֲנָה","transliteration":"anah","gloss":"Anah"},{"id":"H6649","lemma":"צִבְעוֹן","transliteration":"tsivon","gloss":"Zibeon"}],"senses":[{"id":"H8555H","gloss":"Timna","relation":"H8555H ="},{"id":"H8555I","gloss":"Timna","relation":"H8